# A journey of one's own (SCENES, EDIT twice): a scene a row. K1 how long the scene STAYS (SKIPPED: travelling,
# PRESET and MORPH pass it by; AS TRAVELS; or 4 .. 128 bars of its own: it moves on even with TRAVELS by hand),
# K2 moves it earlier or later, K3 picks a scene of any journey and SEL brings it in (or after the last, a scene
# more); SEL with nothing picked opens SCENE.
autoplay 0
wait 300
tap EDIT
expect view 2
tap EDIT
expect view 9
expect ssel 0
turn K1 2
expect stays1 2
turn SELECT 1
turn K1 -1
expect skip2 1
shot scenes_page.png
tap HOME
# scene 1 stays 8 bars (90 BPM: 21 s), then on to scene 3, scene 2 passed by
tap SEQ
wait 20000
expect scene 1
wait 15000
expect scene 3
# PRESET back: scene 1, past the skipped one
turn PRESET -1
wait 13000
expect scene 1
# BRING IN: PENUMBRA's second scene (its key D) over scene 4. K3's first turn shows ECLIPSE 1, then on
# through ECLIPSE's four to PENUMBRA's
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
turn SELECT 3
expect ssel 3
turn K3 6
expect bring_on 1
expect sroot4 9
shot bring_in.png
tap SEL
expect sroot4 2
expect bring_on 0
expect view 9
# K2: scene 4 moves to be scene 3 (scene 3, in F, to 4)
turn K2 -1
wait 100
expect ssel 2
expect sroot3 2
expect sroot4 5
expect skip2 1
expect nscenes 4
# the row after the last: a scene more (K3's first turn: the one picked last, PENUMBRA 2)
turn SELECT 8
expect ssel 4
turn K3 1
tap SEL
expect nscenes 5
expect sroot5 2
# a turn of SELECT lets a pick go
turn K3 1
turn SELECT -1
expect bring_on 0
tap SEL
expect view 2
expect ssel 3
tap EDIT
expect view 9
